      "type": "contract",
            "statement": "Viewer-equivalent humans can read a typed camel-case structural configuration schema containing only deployment-owned fields and identifying semantic checks enforced by PATCH, while PATCH rejects unknown, template-owned, coerced, empty, and invalid nullable values without reflecting request content.",
